WEBVTT

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.700
Tellerline: Hello, you're through to Tellerline Bank. I'm an AI assistant. How can I help you today?

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.260
Caller: Hi, I think my bank card has been stolen.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.960
Tellerline: Could you tell me your eight-digit customer number and your date of birth, please?

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:31.300
Caller: Sure, my customer number is 45127890 and my date of birth is the 3rd of March 1991.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Tellerline: Thanks, Aoife, you're verified. What can I help you with?

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.420
Caller: My card ending 4217 was taken out of my bag on the bus.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.780
Tellerline: I've frozen that card for you.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.680
Tellerline: It's the card ending four two one seven, so it can't be used now.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.140
Tellerline: Would you like me to order a replacement?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.040
Caller: Yes please.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.605
Tellerline: I've ordered you a replacement card.

00:00:56.605 --> 00:00:59.301
Tellerline: It replaces the card ending four two one seven,

00:00:59.301 --> 00:01:01.940
Tellerline: and it should arrive within five working days.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.780
Caller: That's everything, thanks. Bye.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:09.120
Tellerline: Thanks for calling Tellerline Bank. Goodbye.
